"role.tanukiSonarman.name" : "Sonarman"
"role.tanukiSonarman.short" : "SON"
"role.tanukiSonarman.blurb" : "Find the direction of unseen voices."
"role.tanukiSonarman.generalBlurb" : "Find the direction of unseen voices."
"role.tanukiSonarman.doc" : "Available to Crewmates and Madmates.<br>Activate a temporary voice radar around yourself.<br>Dots on its circumference show directions where players spoke within the configured range, even through walls.<br>Dots update once per complete sweep."
"role.tanukiSonarman.tips" : "Voice volume, audible distance and wall occlusion stay the same.<br>A local sonar ping plays on activation and once per sweep. It follows the game SFX volume and stops when the ability ends.<br>Only you see the radar. Dots do not reveal names, teams or distance.<br>Each sweep uses the latest speech position from that interval. Silent players are not continuously tracked and their dots disappear after the next silent sweep.<br>Your own microphone, ghosts, disconnected players, muted microphones and recordings are excluded.<br>Meetings, death, game end and role removal stop the radar. Cooldown starts when the effect ends.<br>Use a duration longer than one sweep; stopping before a full sweep produces no dots.<br>Players need compatible BetterCrewLink and a working microphone. The host supplies existing Web/mobile voice metrics."
"options.role.tanukiSonarman.detail" : "Reveal directions of speech through walls without changing voice playback."
"options.role.tanukiSonarman.duration" : "Radar duration"
"options.role.tanukiSonarman.cooldown" : "Ability cooldown"
"options.role.tanukiSonarman.range" : "Speech detection range"
"options.role.tanukiSonarman.sweep" : "Time per sweep"
"button.label.tanukiSonarman.scan" : "Scan"
"button.label.tanukiSonarman.scanning" : "Scanning"
